  "description": "Local Shen, Urgot, and Yone joint review bundle. It keeps the fixed battle scale and compact portraits for Shen, Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir; uses Shen's visible spirit-blade Q return and native 1.5-second E taunt; keeps Urgot W on the crash-safe single-hit pure-data route and E on the rush-behind flip contract; and rebuilds Yone with guarded Q1/Q2/Q3 progression, one airborne Q3 wind lane, and an E-only Soul Unbound slot. Yone E leaves an opaque body at the cast point while the real caster fights as a sparsely outlined spirit; its damage ledger is isolated per simulation and its bounded return uses fast CC-immune pathing. Mod API 0.8 cannot directly write hero coordinates, so this build does not claim an instantaneous terrain-ignoring position snap. This local integration build does not merge either Draft PR. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
